From dfd11d47fea3ba7ad673582e8224724da312bc34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 00:54:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: admin-managed share allowlist (server + web)

Lets an admin opt a user into a share allowlist: once at least one
entry exists for that account, they may ONLY share albums/assets with
the users on the list. Accounts with no entries are unrestricted
(stock Immich behavior, unchanged).

- new table user_share_allowlist (ownerId, allowedUserId)
- checks wired into AlbumService.create / addUsers
- admin API: GET/PUT /admin/users/:id/share-allowlist
- web UI: new card on /admin/users/:id with add/remove modal
- OpenAPI spec + @immich/sdk regenerated

Based on immich-app/immich@b26b0cc
